(text "watchdog arm (IC503 1A) and MCU pin 14" (at 109.22 206.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left top)) (uuid 5f02be71-77fe-4eb2-b1d9-79a85a4e3c4b))
(text "NOTES\n- MCU pin numbers per the datasheet QFP drawing (p.6), marking D78F0034BCC (archived datasheet in datasheets/archive/).\n- UART0: PC502 carries panel -> MCU RxD0 (pin 21); PC501 carries MCU TxD0 (pin 22) -> panel.  PC503 (LED driven by the panel on pins 5/1) pulls ARM low = arms watchdog timer 1.\n- APPROXIMATE on the cold side: Q506's exact role, LED polarities of PC501/PC503, resistor values RX40-RX42; R540 not drawn.\n- Never connect a mains-earthed adapter to the hot side. To sniff the link, use the COLD side of CN300 only (see docs/15-future-work.md)." (at 150 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid ce8345da-ce5a-4d95-865c-7dd64f02ecf6))
)